  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Emergency response and capacity building in Karo and Dairi</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CAFOD&#x2019;s grant enabled the local Caritas organisation in the Archdiocese of Medan to respond usefully to a serious emergency following the eruption of Mt Sinabung in August 2010, by distributing relief assistance to meet the basic needs of 600 families.  The balance of the grant is being used to provide training for 60 key people (government officers, staff of non-governmental agencies and youth leaders) in Karo and Dairi Districts, which are very vulnerable to volcanic eruptions and earthquakes, so they will be better prepared when another next emergency arises.</narrative>
  </description>
